    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "セイウンスカイ",
            "enName": "Seiun Sky",
            "jpText": "あーあ。なーんか最近、\r\n宿題多くなーい？",
            "enText": "<i>Sigh…</i> Why are we getting\nso much homework lately?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 6670390338491322432,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キングヘイロー",
            "enName": "King Halo",
            "jpText": "そう？　普通だと思うけど？",
            "enText": "Are we? I can't say I've noticed any change.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 4211576497143609655,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "セイウンスカイ",
            "enName": "Seiun Sky",
            "jpText": "げっ……それ本気で言ってる？",
            "enText": "<i>Ngh…</i> Are you being serious?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -3828242884884305184,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キングヘイロー",
            "enName": "King Halo",
            "jpText": "ええ、だって明日の数学の課題も、\r\nもう解き終わってるし……。",
            "enText": "I am. In fact, I've already finished\nthe math homework due tomorrow…",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -241320708434774585,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "セイウンスカイ",
            "enName": "Seiun Sky",
            "jpText": "え～！？　うっそー？\r\nだってあれ結構難しかったよー？",
            "enText": "What?! No way! But those were so hard…",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 7852368127858181721,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "セイウンスカイ",
            "enName": "Seiun Sky",
            "jpText": "……はっ！　実は答え、\r\n全部埋めてなかったりして？",
            "enText": "…Oh, I getcha. You just filled in an answer\nto get it done, didn't you?",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 364475258281468605,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キングヘイロー",
            "enName": "King Halo",
            "jpText": "なわけないでしょう！　まったく……。\r\nそんなに疑うなら、証拠を見せてあげるわ！",
            "enText": "I would never! I always show\nmy work… and I'll prove it!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 1507979884329364253,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キングヘイロー",
            "enName": "King Halo",
            "jpText": "後で私の部屋にいらっしゃい！",
            "enText": "Come to my room later today!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -5757030238008253384,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "セイウンスカイ",
            "enName": "Seiun Sky",
            "jpText": "はいはーい。じゃあ後で\r\nうかがわせてもらいまーす。",
            "enText": "All right… We'll see who proves who wrong…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -3275998985720940162,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "セイウンスカイ",
            "enName": "Seiun Sky",
            "jpText": "……やー。いつもいつも、\r\n本当、助かるよー。てへっ☆",
            "enText": "…And I might take a quick peek at your\nanswers while I'm there. Teehee☆",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -1406910109420768140,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
